---
description: React component patterns and JSX conventions
globs: **/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

- Arrow functions only; named export on the component (e.g. `export const Foo = () => {}`). No default exports or imports in `src/components/` or `packages/ui`.
- JSX props: alphabetical order, callbacks last, shorthand first.
- Self-closing tags for empty elements; no `React.` namespace — use named imports.
- Lucide icons: `XxxxIcon` suffix (`SunIcon`, not `Sun`).
- Shared components live in `packages/ui/src/components/`; app-only components in `apps/<app>/src/components/`.
- shadcn/ui components go in `packages/ui/src/components/ui/` — add via `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` from `packages/ui`, then rewrite the generated `@/lib/utils` import to a relative path and re-export from `packages/ui/src/index.ts`.
- Inside `packages/ui` never use the `@/` alias; it belongs to the consuming app and would resolve to that app's `src/`.
- Colocate tests (`*.test.tsx`) and stories (`*.stories.tsx`) with components when applicable.
